-*   **Weight:** $w_i = T_i (1 - \exp(-\sigma_i \delta_i))$ [S2, unofficial].
-*   **RGB:** $C = \sum w_i c_i$ [S4, unofficial].
-*   **Depth:** $D = \sum w_i d_i$ [S4, unofficial].
